-<html lang="en">
-<head>
-<title>SPAN attribute in COL element being ignored.</title>
-
-<style type="text/css">
-pre {font:1em monospace; margin-left:15px; color:#000066;}
-
-td {border:thin solid black;}
-
-.aside {font-style:italic;}
-
